#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md:71
#: 81905d94df0449c3a1835a93d0ce4fd7
msgid ""
"Build (README): `colcon build --packages-up-to ocs2_arm_controller "
"--symlink-install`."
msgstr "colcon build --packages-up-to ocs2_arm_controller\n"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md:73
#: 3936a1564ba642e5bd6dcf00253c1a5c
msgid "End-effectors (`type` / `left_type` / `right_type`)"
msgstr "末端执行器（`type` / `left_type` / `right_type`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md:75
#: 8940ef17107b4e8498d4b013765ddd5f
msgid ""
"`demo.launch.py`, `split_body.launch.py`, and `full_body.launch.py` "
"declare `type` and also call `create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()` "
"from [`robot_common_launch`](../descriptions/2-common.md). That helper "
"adds **`left_type` / `right_type`** (and `use_profile_eef` / "
"`robot_profile`). There is no `gripper:=` argument."
msgstr ""
"`demo.launch.py`、`split_body.launch.py` 和 `full_body.launch.py` 声明 "
"`type`，并调用 [`robot_common_launch`](../descriptions/2-common.md) 的 "
"`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`。该辅助函数增加 **`left_type` / "
"`right_type`**（以及 `use_profile_eef` / `robot_profile`）。没有 `gripper:=` 参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md:77
#: c5d3b51672dd4d818d5c7cd432e68b36
msgid ""
"From `create_eef_side_launch_arguments()`: `left_type` is a left EEF key "
"(`rg75`, `ag2f90_c`, `linkerhand_o7`, …). Use with `right_type` for "
"asymmetric setups; **do not pass `type:=`** in that case."
msgstr ""
"出自 `create_eef_side_launch_arguments()`：`left_type` "
"是左侧末端键（`rg75`、`ag2f90_c`、`linkerhand_o7` 等）。与 `right_type` "
"一起用于左右不同的配置；此时**不要再传 `type:=`**。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md:79
#: 8a7388bbe00e41d09508ff210a1c095f
msgid ""
"# Symmetric EEF (package README)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py type:=AG2F90-C\n"
"\n"
"# Different L/R (robot_common_launch README)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py \\\n"
"  robot_profile:=/path/to/machine_profile.yaml \\\n"
"  use_profile_eef:=false \\\n"
"  left_type:=rg75 right_type:=linkerhand_o7"
msgstr ""
"# Symmetric EEF (package README)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py type:=AG2F90-C\n"
"\n"
"# Different L/R (robot_common_launch README)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py \\\n"
"  robot_profile:=/path/to/machine_profile.yaml \\\n"
"  use_profile_eef:=false \\\n"
"  left_type:=rg75 right_type:=linkerhand_o7"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md:90
#: 1ee7e87483394f82956f05bef7f9a1a2
msgid ""
"`type` may also be arm topology `left` / `right` / `dual` (does **not** "
"expand to `left_type` / `right_type`). Full merge rules: "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md)."
msgstr ""
"`type` 也可以是臂拓扑 `left` / `right` / `dual`（**不会**展开成 `left_type` / "
"`right_type`）。完整合并规则见 [robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md:92
#: 991bbf7f062d4407a3f63c37c8a95375
